@api = http://localhost:5082

### 1. Success
POST {{api}}/api/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "accountNumber": "001234567890", "amount": 150.750, "currency": "LYD", "reference": "MW-001" }




### 2. Same Reference again (duplicate)
POST {{api}}/api/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "accountNumber": "001234567890", "amount": 150.750, "currency": "LYD", "reference": "MW-001" }

### 3. Bank 400
POST {{api}}/api/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "accountNumber": "001234567890", "amount": 400, "currency": "LYD", "reference": "MW-002" }

### 4. Bank 500
POST {{api}}/api/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "accountNumber": "001234567890", "amount": 500, "currency": "LYD", "reference": "MW-003" }

### 5. Timeout
POST {{api}}/api/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "accountNumber": "001234567890", "amount": 999, "currency": "LYD", "reference": "MW-004" }

### 6. Business Error
POST {{api}}/api/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "accountNumber": "001234567890", "amount": 20000, "currency": "LYD", "reference": "MW-005" }

### 7. Invalid amount
POST {{api}}/api/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "accountNumber": "001234567890", "amount": -5, "currency": "LYD", "reference": "MW-006" }